{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03178","headline":"西陵峡 · 杨炯","name":"西陵峡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝壁耸万仞，长波射千里。\n盘薄荆之门，滔滔南国纪。\n楚都昔全盛，高丘烜望祀。\n秦兵一旦侵，夷陵火潜起。\n四维不复设，关塞良难恃。\n洞庭且忽焉，孟门终已矣。\n自古天地辟，流爲峡中水。\n行旅相赠言，风涛无极已。\n及余践斯地，瓌奇信爲美。\n江山若有灵，千载伸知己。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨炯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03178.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03178","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}